<lint>
    <!-- FloorTrustManager is a custom trust manager that trusts strictly less than the platform:
         every decision is the platform trust manager's, and the floor only refuses chains it
         accepted. CustomX509TrustManager cannot see that, and TlsFloorTest proves it (an
         untrusted anchor and a wrong hostname still fail). Any other custom trust manager in
         this app must be reviewed, so the exemption names the one file. -->
    <issue id="CustomX509TrustManager">
        <ignore path="src/main/java/org/kysecurity/drive/core/Tls.kt" />
    </issue>
</lint>
